# U4 fail/sema fixture (relocated from origin's cgfail/): a match on an enum that
# omits a variant without a wildcard is non-exhaustive and is rejected by Sema in
# ALL build modes with a located error. Pattern combines the canonical
# file:line:col: error: format with the specific missing-variant message.
^[^:]+\.b:[0-9]+:[0-9]+: error: non-exhaustive match: variant '[a-zA-Z_]+' of enum '[A-Za-z_]+' is not handled$
